 def job_copy(name, overlay=None):                                              
     """A throwaway copy of the job-rejected fixture, WITH the logger's own     
 times in its harness logs (LOGGED):                                            
     a record can only be written from a log the emitter can honestly read. The 
 cases that assert a refusal                                                    
     depending on the fixture's server-times-only log drive FIX directly (T2,   
